     "<div style=\"font-size:1em;font-family:Helvetica,arial,freesans,clean,sans-serif;color:rgb(34,34,34);border:none;line-height:1.2;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><p style=\"margin:1em 0px\">Thanks to Carl Boettiger for today’s talk at D-RUG on using <a href=\"http://ropensci.org/\" style=\"color:rgb(51,51,238);text-decoration:none\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://ropensci.org/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792468432759000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0j3VVICl9TzmyRV8PYsoxI\">ROpenSci</a> packages for retreiving data from and uploading to online data repositories</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:1em 0px\">We’ve put the screencast on YouTube <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=JNVRxq-hS9M\" style=\"color:rgb(51,51,238);text-decoration:none\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.youtube.com/watch?v%3DJNVRxq-hS9M&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792468432759000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1r9_ePWTvttYGopkFcvYYy\">here</a>.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:1em 0px\">You can get the files from the talk at <a href=\"https://github.com/ropensci/workshops-davis-2015-01\" style=\"color:rgb(51,51,238);text-decoration:none\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/ropensci/workshops-davis-2015-01&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792468432759000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0O7FiO-7I20sv04IfWG1b1\">this Github repository</a>. (Here’s the direct *.zip <a href=\"https://github.com/ropensci/workshops-davis-2015-01/archive/gh-pages.zip\" style=\"color:rgb(51,51,238);text-decoration:none\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/ropensci/workshops-davis-2015-01/archive/gh-pages.zip&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792468432759000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0H8c_vEx_YoU7SsBxPFCOF\">download link</a>)</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:1em 0px\">-Noam</p>\r\n<div title=\"MD